{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamster towers with unique attacks, upgrades, and playstyles form the core of your defense. Three equippable item slots for even more power! How strong can you make your Hamsters?\u00a0Face off against quirky enemy waves, unlock powerful trinkets, and climb the cheese ladder to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/32d394e76e46d570275abdf2fff58251.avif?t=1773353554\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Items to make your Units even stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump into a wild, procedurally generated battlefield where no two runs are ever the same!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Far will you get in the ENDLESS mode?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>26 Handcrafted Maps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted journey across unique levels where strategy meets story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 Different Themes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level theme has different twists and gameplay variations: <strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>Fall</strong>, <strong>Desert</strong>, <strong>Night</strong>, <strong>Hell</strong>.. and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked and Competitive Aspect!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard! Test your skills in seasonal runs with fair rules, competitive loadouts, and leaderboard rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daily Quests!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh challenges every day! Complete bite-sized missions for cheese crystal to buy new heroes, skins and maps!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hamster glory! From silly to skillful, collect dozens of in-game achievements that show off your cheese defense legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Game Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drip your defense! Spend your hard-earned crystal cheese on, skins, and trinkets, all purely\u00a0cosmetic, all squeak-approved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamster towers with 47 unique <strong>ITEMS</strong> and attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIVE\u00a0</strong>combat units, each transformable into 3 classes with the mystical <strong>SOUL CORE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MODES\u00a0</strong>including Endless, ARAM, and seed runs for infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige progression system unlocks dailies, journey mode, ranked, and more as you grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shop with cosmetic skins, trinkets, and heroes. All earned through play, no real money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816380?t=1773353554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816380?t=1773353554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/63f2f662e4de404ef82acbd7e97f9d28596c68a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773353554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/63f2f662e4de404ef82acbd7e97f9d28596c68a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773353554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4316810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamster towers with unique attacks, upgrades, and playstyles form the core of your defense. Three equippable item slots for even more power! How strong can you make your Hamsters?\u00a0Face off against quirky enemy waves, unlock powerful trinkets, and climb the cheese ladder to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/32d394e76e46d570275abdf2fff58251.avif?t=1773353554\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Items to make your Units even stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ddf039a0cc5fed6250ec5bec27b3e539.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump into a wild, procedurally generated battlefield where no two runs are ever the same!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/0c9f95bdbca4bd6e8b6e00d835f89b82.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Far will you get in the ENDLESS mode?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.poster.avif?t=1773353554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.webm?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/ea97e5c7fae5bef610797c88ce8659bf.mp4?t=1773353554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>26 Handcrafted Maps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted journey across unique levels where strategy meets story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 Different Themes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level theme has different twists and gameplay variations: <strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>Fall</strong>, <strong>Desert</strong>, <strong>Night</strong>, <strong>Hell</strong>.. and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked and Competitive Aspect!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard! Test your skills in seasonal runs with fair rules, competitive loadouts, and leaderboard rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daily Quests!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh challenges every day! Complete bite-sized missions for cheese crystal to buy new heroes, skins and maps!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hamster glory! From silly to skillful, collect dozens of in-game achievements that show off your cheese defense legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Game Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drip your defense! Spend your hard-earned crystal cheese on, skins, and trinkets, all purely\u00a0cosmetic, all squeak-approved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamster towers with 47 unique <strong>ITEMS</strong> and attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIVE\u00a0</strong>combat units, each transformable into 3 classes with the mystical <strong>SOUL CORE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MODES\u00a0</strong>including Endless, ARAM, and seed runs for infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige progression system unlocks dailies, journey mode, ranked, and more as you grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shop with cosmetic skins, trinkets, and heroes. All earned through play, no real money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["25 Crimson"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/57673be91d632de86900d5317069d8c31d1dc881/header.jpg?t=1773353554","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816380/1903046804/b933e7a642a54c98aa4f98425a281ca5